  "description": "Ambient values and the wind target at 24-bit precision. 6.1: ambient := r24(r24(1 + r24(cos(r24(k * w)) * r24(ampB * ampA))) * base) with k = m - 8 (temperature) or m - 1 (moisture), w = float32(pi/6) and the cosine of the rounded angle taken in double. Shipped tuning 65 / 0.5 / 0.5 and 0.2 / 0.2 / 1: temperature month 1 -> 50.92708969116211 but month 3 -> 50.927085876464844 (the rounded angles differ), 7 -> 79.07291412353516, 4 -> 56.875, 8 -> 81.25, 2 -> 48.75; moisture 1 -> 0.24000000953674316, 2 -> 0.23464103043079376, 3 -> 0.2200000137090683, 5 -> 0.17999999225139618, 7 -> 0.1600000113248825 (weather tests 1 and 10). 6.2 with stub draws: speed = r24(r24(u * 2) + 2), u = 0.3 -> 2.5999999046325684; s = r24(g * spread) with the shipped spread float32(tan(60 pi/360) * 0.5) = 0.28867513; c = r24(sqrt(r24(1 - r24(s * s)))); direction (r24(r24(bx c) - r24(bz s)), r24(r24(bz c) + r24(bx s))): g = 0.5, base (1, 0) -> (0.9895285367965698, 0.14433756470680237); g = -1.7, base (0, 1) -> (0.49074772000312805, 0.8713017106056213); g = 3 -> s = 0.8660253882408142 is accepted (|s| <= 1), base (0, 1) -> (-0.8660253882408142, 0.5). Values from an independent Python/numpy model; compared exactly.",
